    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5554" root="جرع" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرَعٌ</span></b>  <i>A twisting in one of the strands of a
rope,</i> (S, K,) or <i>of a bow-string,</i> (K,) <i>so that
it appears above the other strands.</i> (S, K.) [It
is app. an inf. n., of which the verb, if it have
one, is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِعَ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرَعَةٌ</span>.

